    3. Pick margins (top 1-2, left 1-2, right 1-2, bottom 0)
    4. Grid size = (frame_height + margin_top, frame_width + margin_left + margin_right)
    5. Place U-frame (left wall, right wall, bottom bar) with frame color
    6. Fill bottom (interior_height - empty_rows) rows of interior with fill color
    7. Build 3x3 output by painting empty_rows cells along spiral with fill color
